{"seq":3,"slug":"release-ota-update","title":"React Native 发布流程与 OTA 热更新","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/react-native-development/production-engineering/release-ota-update","wordCount":1044,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"react-native-发布流程与-ota-热更新\">React Native 发布流程与 OTA 热更新</h1><p>将一个 React Native 应用推向生产并持续迭代，需要处理两个维度的复杂性：一是应用商店的发布流程（Apple App Store 的严格审核、Google Play 的发布轨道管理）；二是在发布后快速推送修复的能力（OTA 热更新）。这两个维度相互补充：应用商店保证了用户获取经过验证的完整应用，OTA 在审核周期外提供了快速修复关键 bug 的能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>EAS Build（Expo Application Services）</strong>：Expo 官方的云端构建服务，支持 iOS 和 Android 的生产构建，无需本地 Mac（iOS 构建）；通过 <code>eas.json</code> 配置不同构建档案（development / preview / production）。</li>\n<li><strong>EAS Update（OTA）</strong>：Expo 的 OTA 热更新服务，将 JavaScript Bundle 和资源更新推送到已安装的应用，无需应用商店审核；替代了 Microsoft CodePush（已于 2024 年停服）。</li>\n<li><strong>CodePush（已停服）</strong>：微软 App Center 的 OTA 服务，于 2024 年 3 月停止服务；使用它的项目应迁移到 EAS Update 或 Expo Updates。</li>\n<li><strong>发布轨道（Release Track）</strong>：Google Play 的分阶段发布机制（内部 → Alpha → Beta → 生产），允许在全量发布前在小范围用户中验证新版本。</li>\n<li><strong>OTA 的法律和技术限制</strong>：App Store 允许通过 OTA 更新 JavaScript 和资源，但<strong>禁止通过 OTA 添加新的原生功能</strong>或从根本上改变应用性质；违反此条款可能导致应用被下架。</li>\n<li><strong><code>expo-updates</code></strong>：Expo 的更新运行时库，集成在应用中，负责在启动时检查、下载、应用 OTA 更新；支持后台更新、回滚、更新策略配置。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"eas-build-云端构建配置\">EAS Build：云端构建配置</h2><p>EAS Build 消除了对本地 Mac 进行 iOS 构建的依赖，也统一了 CI/CD 中的构建环境：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// eas.json&#10;{&#10;  &quot;cli&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;version&quot;: &quot;&gt;= 7.0.0&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;development&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;developmentClient&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;distribution&quot;: &quot;internal&quot;,&#10;      &quot;ios&quot;: { &quot;simulator&quot;: true }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;preview&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;distribution&quot;: &quot;internal&quot;,&#10;      &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;preview&quot;,&#10;      &quot;android&quot;: { &quot;buildType&quot;: &quot;apk&quot; }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;production&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;channel&quot;: &quot;production&quot;,&#10;      &quot;autoIncrement&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;ios&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;enterpriseProvisioning&quot;: &quot;universal&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;android&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;buildType&quot;: &quot;app-bundle&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;submit&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;production&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;ios&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;appleId&quot;: &quot;developer@company.com&quot;,&#10;        &quot;ascAppId&quot;: &quot;1234567890&quot;&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;android&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;serviceAccountKeyPath&quot;: &quot;./google-play-key.json&quot;,&#10;        &quot;track&quot;: &quot;production&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// eas.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cli\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\">= 7.0.0\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"development\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"developmentClient\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"distribution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"internal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"ios\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"simulator\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"preview\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"distribution\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"internal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"preview\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"android\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"buildType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"apk\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"production\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"channel\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"production\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"autoIncrement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"ios\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"enterpriseProvisioning\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"universal\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"android\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"buildType\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"app-bundle\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"submit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"production\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"ios\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"appleId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"developer@company.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"ascAppId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1234567890\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"android\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"serviceAccountKeyPath\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./google-play-key.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"track\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"production\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>常用构建命令</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 构建 iOS 生产版本并提交 App Store&#10;eas build --platform ios --profile production&#10;eas submit --platform ios --latest&#10;&#10;# 构建 Android AAB 并提交 Google Play&#10;eas build --platform android --profile production&#10;eas submit --platform android --latest&#10;&#10;# 构建内部测试版本（快速，不需要签名证书）&#10;eas build --platform all --profile preview\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 构建 iOS 生产版本并提交 App Store</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">eas</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --platform</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ios</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --profile</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">eas</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> submit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --platform</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ios</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 构建 Android AAB 并提交 Google Play</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">eas</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --platform</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> android</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --profile</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">eas</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> submit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --platform</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> android</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 构建内部测试版本（快速，不需要签名证书）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">eas</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --platform</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> all</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --profile</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> preview</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"应用版本管理策略\">应用版本管理策略</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Dev[开发分支\\ndev channel]&#10;    Preview[预览构建\\npreview channel]&#10;    Stage[灰度发布\\n10% 用户]&#10;    Prod[全量生产\\n100% 用户]&#10;&#10;    Dev --&gt; Preview&#10;    Preview --&gt; Stage&#10;    Stage --&gt; Prod\">graph LR\n    Dev[开发分支\\ndev channel]\n    Preview[预览构建\\npreview channel]\n    Stage[灰度发布\\n10% 用户]\n    Prod[全量生产\\n100% 用户]\n\n    Dev --&gt; Preview\n    Preview --&gt; Stage\n    Stage --&gt; Prod</pre><p><strong>版本号约定</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>管理方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>version</code>（app.json）</td>\n<td>用户可见的语义版本（1.2.3）</td>\n<td>每次功能发版手动递增</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>buildNumber</code>（iOS）</td>\n<td>App Store 上传递增整数</td>\n<td><code>eas build --auto-increment</code> 自动管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>versionCode</code>（Android）</td>\n<td>Google Play 上传递增整数</td>\n<td><code>eas build --auto-increment</code> 自动管理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>OTA 更新不需要改变 <code>version</code>，但对于包含显著功能变化的 OTA 更新，建议修改 <code>version</code> 以便在 crash 报告中区分版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"eas-update-ota-热更新实战\">EAS Update：OTA 热更新实战</h2><h3 id=\"基础配置\">基础配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// app.json 或 app.config.ts&#10;{&#10;  &quot;expo&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;updates&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;enabled&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;checkAutomatically&quot;: &quot;ON_LOAD&quot;,  // 或 &quot;ON_ERROR_RECOVERY&quot; / &quot;NEVER&quot;&#10;      &quot;fallbackToCacheTimeout&quot;: 0       // 0ms = 仅在有更新时才等待，否则立即启动&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;runtimeVersion&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;policy&quot;: &quot;appVersion&quot;  // 运行时版本 = app.json 的 version 字段&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app.json 或 app.config.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"expo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"updates\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"enabled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"checkAutomatically\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ON_LOAD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 或 \"ON_ERROR_RECOVERY\" / \"NEVER\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"fallbackToCacheTimeout\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // 0ms = 仅在有更新时才等待，否则立即启动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"runtimeVersion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"appVersion\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 运行时版本 = app.json 的 version 字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>运行时版本（Runtime Version）<strong>是 OTA 兼容性的关键概念：OTA 更新只能推送到具有</strong>相同运行时版本</strong>的应用构建。当原生代码变化（添加新原生模块、升级 React Native 版本）时，必须发布新的应用商店版本并更新运行时版本，OTA 无法跨越原生代码变化。</p>\n<h3 id=\"更新策略-平衡速度与稳定性\">更新策略：平衡速度与稳定性</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 自定义更新检查逻辑&#10;import * as Updates from &#39;expo-updates&#39;;&#10;&#10;async function checkForUpdates() {&#10;  try {&#10;    const update = await Updates.checkForUpdateAsync();&#10;&#10;    if (update.isAvailable) {&#10;      // 后台下载更新&#10;      await Updates.fetchUpdateAsync();&#10;&#10;      // 策略一：立即重启应用应用更新（适合修复严重 bug）&#10;      await Updates.reloadAsync();&#10;&#10;      // 策略二：提示用户决定何时更新（适合功能更新）&#10;      // showUpdatePrompt(() =&gt; Updates.reloadAsync());&#10;&#10;      // 策略三：在下次应用启动时自动应用（最温和，默认推荐）&#10;      // 不调用 reloadAsync，下次冷启动时自动加载新 bundle&#10;    }&#10;  } catch (error) {&#10;    // 更新失败不应影响应用正常运行&#10;    console.warn(&#39;Update check failed:&#39;, error);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 自定义更新检查逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Updates </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'expo-updates'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> checkForUpdates</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> update</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Updates.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">checkForUpdateAsync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (update.isAvailable) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 后台下载更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Updates.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fetchUpdateAsync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 策略一：立即重启应用应用更新（适合修复严重 bug）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Updates.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reloadAsync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 策略二：提示用户决定何时更新（适合功能更新）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // showUpdatePrompt(() => Updates.reloadAsync());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 策略三：在下次应用启动时自动应用（最温和，默认推荐）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 不调用 reloadAsync，下次冷启动时自动加载新 bundle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 更新失败不应影响应用正常运行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">warn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Update check failed:'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, error);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>更新回滚</strong>：EAS Update 支持将某个频道回滚到历史版本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 列出某频道的更新历史&#10;eas update:list --channel production&#10;&#10;# 回滚到特定更新 ID&#10;eas update:republish --channel production --updateId &lt;id&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 列出某频道的更新历史</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">eas</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> update:list</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --channel</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 回滚到特定更新 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">eas</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> update:republish</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --channel</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> production</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --updateId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ci-cd-集成\">CI/CD 集成</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/deploy.yml&#10;name: Deploy to Production&#10;&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  deploy_ota:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - name: Setup Node&#10;        uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 22&#10;&#10;      - name: Install dependencies&#10;        run: pnpm install&#10;&#10;      - name: Run tests&#10;        run: pnpm test --passWithNoTests&#10;&#10;      - name: Publish OTA Update&#10;        run: eas update --channel production --message &quot;${{ github.event.head_commit.message }}&quot;&#10;        env:&#10;          EXPO_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.EXPO_TOKEN }}&#10;&#10;  build_native:&#10;    if: contains(github.event.head_commit.message, &#39;[native]&#39;)&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - name: Trigger EAS Build&#10;        run: eas build --platform all --profile production --non-interactive&#10;        env:&#10;          EXPO_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.EXPO_TOKEN }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/deploy.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deploy to Production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  deploy_ota</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Setup Node</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">22</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Install dependencies</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm test --passWithNoTests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Publish OTA Update</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">eas update --channel production --message \"${{ github.event.head_commit.message }}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          EXPO_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.EXPO_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  build_native</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">contains(github.event.head_commit.message, '[native]')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Trigger EAS Build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">eas build --platform all --profile production --non-interactive</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          EXPO_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.EXPO_TOKEN }}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当 commit message 包含 <code>[native]</code> 时触发完整的原生构建，否则只推送 OTA 更新——这是常见的双轨发布策略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"crash-监控与-source-map\">Crash 监控与 Source Map</h2><p>生产应用必须接入 Crash 监控，Sentry 是 React Native 生态中最成熟的选择：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// App.tsx&#10;import * as Sentry from &#39;@sentry/react-native&#39;;&#10;&#10;Sentry.init({&#10;  dsn: &#39;https://your-dsn@sentry.io/project-id&#39;,&#10;  environment: process.env.NODE_ENV,&#10;  // 性能监控采样率（生产环境通常设 0.1-0.2）&#10;  tracesSampleRate: 0.2,&#10;  // 捕获 Native Crash（iOS/Android 崩溃）&#10;  enableNativeCrashHandling: true,&#10;  // 关联 OTA 更新版本&#10;  release: Updates.updateId ?? &#39;dev&#39;,&#10;  dist: Updates.runtimeVersion ?? &#39;1.0.0&#39;,&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// App.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Sentry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@sentry/react-native'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Sentry.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dsn: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'https://your-dsn@sentry.io/project-id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  environment: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NODE_ENV</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 性能监控采样率（生产环境通常设 0.1-0.2）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tracesSampleRate: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 捕获 Native Crash（iOS/Android 崩溃）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  enableNativeCrashHandling: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 关联 OTA 更新版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  release: Updates.updateId </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'dev'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dist: Updates.runtimeVersion </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '1.0.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Source Map 上传</strong>：生产构建的 JavaScript 是压缩和混淆过的，Crash 报告中的堆栈追踪需要 Source Map 才能还原到可读的代码位置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 在构建后上传 Source Map 到 Sentry&#10;eas build --profile production --platform ios&#10;# EAS Build 配置了 Sentry 后会自动上传 Source Map&#10;# 或手动上传：&#10;sentry-cli react-native upload-dsym --auth-token $SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在构建后上传 Source Map 到 Sentry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">eas</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --profile</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> production</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --platform</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ios</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># EAS Build 配置了 Sentry 后会自动上传 Source Map</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或手动上传：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sentry-cli</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> react-native</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> upload-dsym</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --auth-token</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关于如何在测试阶段提前发现崩溃，参见 <a href=\"testing-quality\">测试与质量保障</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>React Native 的发布工程形成了两条并行轨道：应用商店发布处理原生代码变化和重大版本更新，OTA 热更新处理 JavaScript 层的快速迭代和 bug 修复。EAS Build + EAS Update 将这两条轨道整合在统一的工具链下，并通过&quot;频道 + 运行时版本&quot;机制保证 OTA 只在兼容的应用版本上应用。</p>\n<p>OTA 的最大价值在于跳过应用商店的审核周期（iOS 平均 1-3 天，Android 几小时）来修复生产 bug。合理的更新策略是：紧急安全修复立即重启应用，普通功能更新在下次冷启动时静默应用，重大功能更新显式提示用户。所有生产应用都应接入 Crash 监控并上传 Source Map，使 bug 排查有可追溯的根因。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"React Native 发布流程与 OTA 热更新","id":"react-native-发布流程与-ota-热更新"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"EAS Build：云端构建配置","id":"eas-build-云端构建配置"},{"level":2,"text":"应用版本管理策略","id":"应用版本管理策略"},{"level":2,"text":"EAS Update：OTA 热更新实战","id":"eas-update-ota-热更新实战"},{"level":3,"text":"基础配置","id":"基础配置"},{"level":3,"text":"更新策略：平衡速度与稳定性","id":"更新策略-平衡速度与稳定性"},{"level":3,"text":"CI/CD 集成","id":"ci-cd-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"Crash 监控与 Source Map","id":"crash-监控与-source-map"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"React Native 测试与质量保障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/react-native-development/production-engineering/testing-quality"},"next":null}